In the context of Spring Framework, `SchedulingConfigurer` is an interface that allows you to customize the scheduling configuration in your application. The `configureTasks` method is part of a different interface, `TaskExecutorAutoConfiguration`, but it is not a standard method in `SchedulingConfigurer`.

